      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Recently published international recommendations including Global INitiative for Asthma, PRACTicing ALLergology and Allergic Rhinitis and its Impact on Asthma offer antileukotriene drugs for adult and childhood asthma and allergic rhinitis. In this article we discuss the arguments for and against antileukotriene drugs therapy in the treatment of obstructive lung diseases and rhinitis."},
